		(comment 1 "TALAVERA bench test board - PRELIMINARY, NOT APPROVED")
		(comment 2 "Successor to Wirikuta 1.1. No MCU on the safety path.")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "TALAVERA v1 - SCHEMATIC SKELETON

This sheet is intentionally EMPTY.
Gate 2 (schematic) is NOT approved. No circuit has been designed.

NON-NEGOTIABLE RULES FOR THIS SHEET:
  1. No microcontroller on the arm, fire, or e-stop path. Ever.
  2. Igniter safe state is SHORTED, via a normally-closed contact.
  3. Every safe state must be the DE-ENERGIZED state.
  4. Three series elements to fire: station ARM key, station FIRE
     button, and the bench ARMING PLUG inserted by hand.
  5. The LED beacon is driven from the real ARM/FIRE signals,
     never from a software report of them.
  6. The logger is a passenger: no outputs, no connection to any
     safety net, its own fused and separately regulated rail.
  7. Function-based net names. Test points on every rail and every
     safety signal. ESD protection on all external connectors.

NO CIRCUIT IN THIS PROJECT IS APPROVED.
Pyrotechnic, actuator, battery and high-current circuits require
written sign-off from the named review owner before bring-up."
